<title>Exclamatory Sentence: Explanation and Examples</title>
<meta name="description" content="An exclamatory sentence conveys a strong emotion and ends with an exclamation mark. Exclamatory sentences make statements (just like declarative sentences), but they also convey emotion such as anger, frustration, or joy."/>
